  ('A coworker asks if you want to grab lunch with the group instead of eating at your desk.', 'The team chat asks who''s in for lunch.', '[{"text":"Count me in","value":0.8},{"text":"Depends on the day","value":0.5},{"text":"I''d rather eat at my desk","value":0.2}]'),
  ('You''re the one who has to make small talk with someone new at an event.', 'At an event, you end up next to someone new and nobody is talking.', '[{"text":"I don''t mind starting it","value":0.8},{"text":"I''ll follow their lead","value":0.2}]'),
  ('Someone asks for a favor that''s a genuine inconvenience for you.', 'A friend texts asking for a favor that would eat your whole evening.', '[{"text":"I usually say yes anyway","value":0.8},{"text":"Depends how big a favor","value":0.5},{"text":"I say no if it''s a real hassle","value":0.2}]'),
  ('A friend keeps borrowing money and hasn''t paid you back.', 'A friend still hasn''t paid you back for the last three dinners.', '[{"text":"I bring it up directly","value":0.8},{"text":"I hint at it","value":0.5},{"text":"I let it slide","value":0.2}]'),
  ('You just finished something you''re proud of.', 'You just finished something and it came out better than you hoped.', '[{"text":"I want to tell someone right away","value":0.8},{"text":"It can wait until it comes up","value":0.5},{"text":"I keep it to myself","value":0.2}]'),
  ('Someone sends a short reply that could be read two ways.', 'Your manager messages ''can we talk tomorrow?'' and nothing else.', '[{"text":"I read it plain and move on","value":0.8},{"text":"I reread it a few times","value":0.2}]'),
  ('You need reassurance more often than you would like to admit.', 'After a good night out, you scroll back through the chat to check it really went well.', '[{"text":"Yeah, that lands","value":0.8},{"text":"Not really me","value":0.2}]'),
  ('Things are getting closer with someone.', 'The person you''ve been seeing starts saying ''we'' in texts.', '[{"text":"I lean in","value":0.2},{"text":"I want a bit of room","value":0.8}]'),
  ('Winning the point matters more than keeping the peace.', 'Mid-argument, you find the screenshot that proves your point.', '[{"text":"I keep it to myself","value":0.8},{"text":"I send it","value":0.2}]'),
  ('A free day with nothing scheduled and nobody asking anything of you.', 'A day off, notifications muted, and nobody needs anything from you.', '[{"text":"That is the best kind of day","value":0.8},{"text":"I''d rather have a plan","value":0.2}]'),
  ('Someone says you are good at something you do a lot.', 'A coworker messages ''how are you so good at this?''', '[{"text":"Yeah, I think so too","value":0.8},{"text":"I brush it off","value":0.2}]'),
  ('You can get noticeably better at almost anything with enough reps.', 'Day 1 of a 30-day challenge in an app, and it shows.', '[{"text":"I''ll be better by day 30","value":0.8},{"text":"Some things just are not for me","value":0.2}]'),
  ('How next year goes is mostly up to you.', 'The email lands: the job you wanted went to someone else.', '[{"text":"Next time I''ll do it differently","value":0.8},{"text":"Timing decides more than I do","value":0.2}]'),
  ('A big thing you have to do, and no obvious first step.', 'You move apartments next month and the to-do list is just a title.', '[{"text":"I start somewhere and adjust","value":0.8},{"text":"I stall until it gets urgent","value":0.2}]'),
  ('People would say you are one of the sillier people they know.', 'Someone asks who sends the most memes in the group chat.', '[{"text":"Guilty, that''s me","value":0.8},{"text":"Not me, I just react","value":0.2}]');
